nel, and Herdr mode. The preset copy at `$DSH_HOME/.agent-pre"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"sets/herdr/` is left behind — remove it manually if needed."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
